# Adding child node with two existing children
# 0, 1, 2 heuristic (2)

# Create graph
CreateGraph madagascar

# Add nodes
AddNode madagascar herbivore
AddNode madagascar melman
AddNode madagascar gloria
AddNode madagascar marty

# Add edges
AddEdge madagascar herbivore melman giraffe
AddEdge madagascar herbivore gloria hippo
AddEdge madagascar herbivore marty zebra
